  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c4f37ee0-268b-4215-af2b-42b796c66226.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"568\" height=\"260\"></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>本模組主要基於動畫《遊戲人生》。</p>\n</div>\n<p>新增的終極技能為：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>L&ouml;sen</li>\n<li>tengeki</li>\n</ul>\n<p>特殊技能為：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Magic Beads</li>\n</ul>\n<p>附加技能為：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Umweg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Discord：<a href=\"https://discord.gg/7BMRDZ4vr6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/7BMRDZ4vr6</a></p>\n<p>目前已新增的種族為：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Ex-Machina</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1232792/description_821e35a2-3cef-48c4-979d-b1202f79af3c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"526\" height=\"296\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fl&uuml;gel</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1232792/description_0d750c4b-8a01-403c-bf19-6d8571289102.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"396\" height=\"277\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight:normal\">矮人<br></span><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1232792/description_4624efd3-58e0-4951-8bc5-c31b6ac04c6c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"396\" height=\"277\"></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight:normal\">龍人族</span><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1232792/description_b6a56054-017b-4d37-8eb9-1fc1d94f4df4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"396\" height=\"277\"></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>前置需求：</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tensura-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tensura </a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lendercataclysm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">L_Ender's Cataclysm（可選）</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
